#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture, security concepts, and the inner workings of the Ditana installer."
msgstr "Architectura, concepts da segirezza ed il funcziunament intern da l’installatur da Ditana."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Under the hood"
msgstr "Funcziunament intern"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
msgid ""
"Ditana makes a lot of decisions automatically during installation — from "
"resolving package conflicts to applying CPU-specific mitigations."
msgstr ""
"Ditana prenda bleras decisiuns automaticamain durant l’installaziun – da la "
"schliaziun da conflicts tranter pachets fin a l’applicaziun da mitigiaziuns "
"specificas per la CPU."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
msgid ""
"This section explains the architecture behind those decisions. You do not "
"need to read this to use Ditana daily. However, if you want to understand "
"our \"Configuration as data\" philosophy, learn how the system probes "
"hardware, or intend to contribute to the installer, this is the place to "
"start."
msgstr ""
"Questa secziun explitgescha l’architectura davos questas decisiuns. Vus na "
"stuais betg leger quai per utilisar Ditana mintga di. Sche Vus vulais "
"dentant chapir nossa filosofia «Configuraziun sco datas», emprender co ch’il "
"sistem examinescha la hardware u avais l’intenziun da contribuir a "
"l’installatur, è quai il lieu per cumenzar."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
msgid ""
"[**Configuration as data**](/under-the-hood/configuration-as-data/) — why "
"Ditana separates the installer engine from its knowledge base, and how "
"updates ship without re-spinning an ISO."
msgstr ""
"[**Configuraziun sco datas**](/under-the-hood/configuration-as-data/) – "
"pertge che Ditana separa il motor da l’installatur da sia basa da savida e "
"co che las actualisaziuns vegnan furnidas senza crear in nov ISO."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
msgid ""
"[**Hardware detection**](/under-the-hood/hardware-detection/) — how the "
"installer dynamically probes your hardware at boot time using KDL rules."
msgstr ""
"[**Identificaziun da la hardware**](/under-the-hood/hardware-detection/) – "
"co che l’installatur examinescha dinamicamain Vossa hardware durant l’aviar "
"cun agid da reglas KDL."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
msgid ""
"[**How settings depend on each other**](/under-the-hood/settings-logic/) – "
"the two expression fields in the knowledge base: one keeps an option out of "
"reach, the other moves its value, and most relationships need both."
msgstr ""
"[**Co ch’ils parameters dependan l’in da l’auter**](/under-the-hood/settings-"
"logic/) – ils dus champs d’expressiun en la basa da savida: l’in renda "
"in’opziun inaccessibla, l’auter mida sia valur, e las pli bleras relaziuns "
"dovran omadus."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
msgid ""
"[**CPU mitigations**](/under-the-hood/mitigations/) — detailed documentation "
"on per-CPU vulnerability detection, default kernel parameters, and how to "
"override them."
msgstr ""
"[**Mitigiaziuns da la CPU**](/under-the-hood/mitigations/) – documentaziun "
"detagliada davart l’identificaziun da mancanzas da segirezza per mintga CPU, "
"ils parameters dal kernel che Ditana applitgescha sco standard e co ch’ins "
"po remplazzar quels."
